## Required Validation

DET-OPP-001 should not become a production detection until it passes structured testing.

### Positive Test

Generate:

```text
Remote network authentication
        |
        v
Encoded or otherwise suspicious PowerShell
```

on the same endpoint within the correlation window.

Expected:

```text
DET-OPP-001 candidate triggers
```

### Negative Test 1

Generate remote network authentication without suspicious PowerShell.

Expected:

```text
No trigger
```

### Negative Test 2

Generate suspicious PowerShell without preceding remote network authentication.

Expected:

```text
No correlated trigger
```

### Negative Test 3

Generate both behaviors on different endpoints.

Expected:

```text
No correlated trigger
```

### Time-Window Test

Generate both behaviors outside the configured correlation window.

Expected:

```text
No correlated trigger
```

